WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.050
A complex sentence leans on a little word like because, although, when or if.

00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:10.030
Because Peter was worn out, he answered shortly.

00:00:10.030 --> 00:00:12.910
The because part can’t stand alone.

00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:14.860
It leans on the rest.

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:18.630
When it comes first, put a comma after it.
